# Bright Smile Dental Project Rules

- Follow the docs in `node_modules/next/dist/docs/` before implementing or changing Next.js APIs and conventions.
- Keep message flow intact: WhatsApp webhook input -> Supabase logging -> Gemini response -> outbound log -> WhatsApp reply.
- Preserve resilience behavior: Supabase failures should not block replies, and WhatsApp send retries should remain safe.
- Prefer concise, modular updates in `lib/` for prompts/intents and in `app/api/` for route logic.
- Never commit secrets or environment values from `.env.local`; use env variables only.
- For dashboard changes, keep real-time subscription behavior and polling fallback compatible.
